    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Kind of Card Game Is This?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fantasy-themed card battle where players cleverly use the synergies between cards to attack opponents and capture all strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/10b162163cc5575259afb37e79b09c91.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=638 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/10b162163cc5575259afb37e79b09c91.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/10b162163cc5575259afb37e79b09c91.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can awaken to gain more powerful abilities once specific conditions are met. You can use special card effects to launch surprise attacks on your opponent's main base, cutting off their supply to clinch victory, or strategically plan to conquer each stronghold one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/18e4c53ebbb3a8c2a4033b77141fb31b.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/18e4c53ebbb3a8c2a4033b77141fb31b.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/18e4c53ebbb3a8c2a4033b77141fb31b.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of each match depends on your wise decisions as the commander. After each match, players can use points earned to collect more powerful cards from the store, building a formidable deck to take on increasingly challenging and engaging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/d4bbb5662bfc9ca7a566129b12adb53f.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=800 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/d4bbb5662bfc9ca7a566129b12adb53f.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/d4bbb5662bfc9ca7a566129b12adb53f.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/efe9da4d295728fd30ecf6c3ac36af2f.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=800 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/efe9da4d295728fd30ecf6c3ac36af2f.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/efe9da4d295728fd30ecf6c3ac36af2f.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Kind of Card Game Is This?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fantasy-themed card battle where players cleverly use the synergies between cards to attack opponents and capture all strongholds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/10b162163cc5575259afb37e79b09c91.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=638 height=466 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/10b162163cc5575259afb37e79b09c91.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/10b162163cc5575259afb37e79b09c91.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards can awaken to gain more powerful abilities once specific conditions are met. You can use special card effects to launch surprise attacks on your opponent's main base, cutting off their supply to clinch victory, or strategically plan to conquer each stronghold one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/18e4c53ebbb3a8c2a4033b77141fb31b.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=800 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/18e4c53ebbb3a8c2a4033b77141fb31b.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/18e4c53ebbb3a8c2a4033b77141fb31b.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The outcome of each match depends on your wise decisions as the commander. After each match, players can use points earned to collect more powerful cards from the store, building a formidable deck to take on increasingly challenging and engaging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/d4bbb5662bfc9ca7a566129b12adb53f.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=800 height=548 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/d4bbb5662bfc9ca7a566129b12adb53f.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/d4bbb5662bfc9ca7a566129b12adb53f.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/efe9da4d295728fd30ecf6c3ac36af2f.poster.avif?t=1732849203\" width=800 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/efe9da4d295728fd30ecf6c3ac36af2f.webm?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253040/extras/efe9da4d295728fd30ecf6c3ac36af2f.mp4?t=1732849203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
